#, kde-format
msgid "Installation of %1 failed: %2"
msgstr "Instaliranje „%1“ nije uspjelo: %2"

#: core/installation.cpp:386
#, kde-format
msgid "Could not determine the type of archive of the downloaded file %1"
msgstr "Ne mogu da odredim tip arhive preuzetog fajla %1"

#: core/installation.cpp:398
#, kde-format
msgid "Failed to open the archive file %1. The reported error was: %2"
msgstr "Ne mogu da otvorim arhivski fajl %1. Prijavljena greška: %2"

#: core/installation.cpp:465
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This file already exists on disk (possibly due to an earlier failed download "
"attempt). Continuing means overwriting it. Do you wish to overwrite the "
"existing file?"
msgstr ""
"Ovaj fajl već postoji na disku (možda zbog ranijeg neuspjelog pokušaja "
"preuzimanja). Ako nastavite, biće prebrisan. Želite li da prebrišete "
"postojeći fajl?"

#: core/installation.cpp:468
#, kde-format
msgid "Overwrite File"
msgstr "Prebrisavanje fajla"

#: core/installation.cpp:487
#, kde-format
msgid "Unable to move the file %1 to the intended destination %2"
msgstr "Ne mogu da premjestim fajl %1 na odredište %2"

#: core/installation.cpp:510
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The installation failed while attempting to run the command:\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"The returned output was:\n"
"%2"
msgstr ""
"Instaliranje nije uspjelo pri pokušaju izvršavanja naredbe:\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"Vraćeni izlaz:\n"
"%2"

#: core/installation.cpp:521
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The installation failed with code %1 while attempting to run the command:\n"
"%2\n"
"\n"
"The returned output was:\n"
"%3"
msgstr ""
"Instaliranje nije uspjelo sa kodom %1 pri pokušaju izvršavanja naredbe:\n"
"%2\n"
"\n"
"Vraćeni izlaz:\n"
"%3"

#: core/installation.cpp:563
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The removal of %1 failed, as the installed file %2 could not be "
"automatically removed. You can attempt to manually delete this file, if you "
"believe this is an error."
msgstr ""
"Uklanjanje %1 nije uspjelo jer instalirani fajl %2 nije mogao automatski da "
"se ukloni. Ako mislite da je ovo greška, možete pokušati da ručno obrišete "
"ovaj fajl."

#: core/installation.cpp:632
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The uninstallation process failed to successfully run the command %1\n"
"The output of was: \n"
"%2\n"
"If you think this is incorrect, you can continue or cancel the "
"uninstallation process"
msgstr ""
"Deinstaliranje nije uspjelo da izvrši naredbu %1\n"
"Izlaz: \n"
"%2\n"
"Ako mislite da ovo nije tačno, možete nastaviti ili otkazati deinstaliranje"

#: core/jobs/filecopyworker.cpp:60
#, kde-format
msgid "Could not open %1 for writing"
msgstr "Ne mogu da otvorim %1 za pisanje"

#: core/jobs/filecopyworker.cpp:63
#, kde-format
msgid "Could not open %1 for reading"
msgstr "Ne mogu da otvorim %1 za čitanje"

#: core/transaction.cpp:126
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Could not perform an installation of the entry %1 as it does not have any "
"downloadable items defined. Please contact the author so they can fix this."
msgstr ""
"Ne mogu da instaliram unos %1 jer nema zadatu nijednu stavku za preuzimanje. "
"Obratite se autoru da bi to ispravio."

#: core/transaction.cpp:341
#, kde-format
msgid "Pick Update Item"
msgstr "Izbor stavke za ažuriranje"

#: core/transaction.cpp:343
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Please pick the item from the list below which should be used to apply this "
"update. We were unable to identify which item to select, based on the "
"original item, which was named %1"
msgstr ""
"Sa spiska ispod izaberite stavku koja treba da se upotrijebi za ovo "
"ažuriranje. Nismo mogli da utvrdimo koju stavku treba izabrati na osnovu "
"izvorne stavke, koja se zvala %1"

#: core/transaction.cpp:367
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"We failed to identify a good link for updating %1, and are unable to perform "
"the update"
msgstr ""
"Nismo uspjeli da nađemo dobru vezu za ažuriranje %1, pa ne možemo da "
"izvedemo ažuriranje"

#: core/transaction.cpp:460
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Failed to adopt '%1'\n"
"%2"
msgstr ""
"Ne mogu da usvojim „%1“\n"
"%2"

